  "title": "My Girl",
  "description": "Kazama Masamune - a single 23-year-old man... has a child? During the season of cherry blossoms, his beloved passes away. He happens to meet a little girl outside work and realizes she is his daughter who was raised in secrecy by his lover. The worst spring of his life is transformed into a painful yet vivid spring.\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Drama, Fatherhood, Glasses-Wearing Male Lead, Iyashikei, Loneliness, Male Protagonist, Parenthood, Slice of Life, Working, Adapted to Jdrama, Adapted to Live Action, Character Growth, Childcare, Children, Coming of Age, Dead Family Member, Doting Family Member, Episodic, Family, Family Life, Father, Father and Daughter, Flashbacks, Grief, Illegitimate Child, Kind Male Lead, Lifestyle Change, Male Demographic with Female Author, Male Lead, Mature Child, Melancholy Atmosphere, Mourning, Realistic Relationship, Romantic Subplot, Secret Child Ren, Seinen, Single Parent, Sudden Appearance, Tragedy, Adult Male Lead, Age Gap, Daughter, Grooming, Older Female Younger Male, Older Male Younger Female, Salarymen, Single Father, Tomboys",
